{"id":"76c43204ed5ebccb","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal.md","title":"多项式有界系统必为大小最优系统","display":"thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal — 多项式有界系统必为大小最优系统","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal","aliases":["72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal"],"display":"thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal — 多项式有界系统必为大小最优系统","depends_on":["[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","[[72-df-optimal-proof-system]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4 and optimality definition §10.4, print550,552,626/PDF562,564,638; local consequence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补齐已引用上游的精确显示签名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal — 多项式有界系统必为大小最优系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9414b81590d67b46\" href=\"?note=9414b81590d67b46\" title=\"72-df-optimal-proof-system\">72-df-optimal-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4 and optimality definition §10.4, print550,552,626/PDF562,564,638; local consequence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补齐已引用上游的精确显示签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P 满足 PropProofSystem；PolyBounded 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a>，Optimal 与模拟方向取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9414b81590d67b46\" href=\"?note=9414b81590d67b46\" title=\"72-df-optimal-proof-system\">72-df-optimal-proof-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Optimal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Optimal}\\)</span> 指上游按大小模拟定义的集合；其元素仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ P\\in\\mathrm{Optimal}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ P\\in\\mathrm{Optimal}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意 Q 在输入 π 上输出 τ 的长度受 Q 运行时间的某个多项式控制。P 的多项式有界性给 τ 的短 P 证明，复合两个非负系数界即得 Q≤sim P。没有得到能在多项式时间找到该短证明的转换，所以本条不把 Optimal 升格为 POptimal。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-optimal-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"9414b81590d67b46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-optimal-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"P 满足 PropProofSystem；PolyBounded 取 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]，Optimal 与模拟方向取 [[72-df-optimal-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-optimal-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"9414b81590d67b46","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"P 满足 PropProofSystem；PolyBounded 取 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]，Optimal 与模拟方向取 [[72-df-optimal-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Optimal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ P\\in\\mathrm{Optimal}.","display":true}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-543","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI